   "id": "math.area-under-rate",
   "name": "Area under a rate graph",
   "requires": [],
   "explain": {
    "en": {
     "text": "For a rate function such as velocity or marginal cost, the area under its graph is the total amount: distance, total cost or total profit. Its units are input units × output units. For constant and straight-line rates, rectangles, triangles and trapezoids give the exact area."
    },
    "am": {
     "text": "ለለውጥ መጠን ፋንክሽን (ፍጥነት፣ የህዳግ ወጪ) ከግራፉ ስር ያለው ስፋት ጠቅላላ መጠኑ ነው፤ ርቀት፣ ጠቅላላ ወጪ።",
     "machine": true
    }
   },
